    "text": "𝐅𝐢𝐟𝐭𝐡 𝐃𝐢𝐟𝐟𝐞𝐫𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞: 𝐒𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐫𝐢𝐭𝐲\n\nBoth take security seriously. \n\nBut their records differ.\n\n𝐁𝐢𝐭𝐠𝐞𝐭: $300M protection fund. No major hack on record. Strong KYC and proof of reserves.\n\n𝐁𝐲𝐛𝐢𝐭: $400M insurance fund. Suffered a $1.4B exploit in early 2025.",
